hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1760","Narrated from Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: ""Allah Almighty says: I have prepared for My righteous servants such blessings which no eye has seen, no ear has heard, and no human heart has ever imagined. And the blessings that you have been informed about are insignificant compared to them."" Then he recited this verse: ""No soul knows what comfort of the eyes has been hidden for them."""
